  "label": "fear induced by association with totalitarian oppression",
  "description": "The emotion of fear is evoked through the juxtaposition of Adolf Hitler's intense, authoritarian expression and gesture with the text 'mandatory vaccinations \"no exemptions\"'. The visual of Hitler, a symbol of historical totalitarianism and genocide, is used to imply that mandatory vaccination policies are inherently oppressive or tyrannical, thereby inducing fear in the viewer regarding the potential loss of personal freedom or autonomy under such policies.",
